return [====[><p>Gain +2 Morale DC when dealing melee damage, physical push or wall-crush damage. This stacks with Menacing.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 102</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-cross_boom_battery" data-title="Boom Battery"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Boom Battery</h2><section class="entry" id="CROSS_BOOM_BATTERY"><h3>Boom Battery</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 and INT 15 / Capability: exploding_nonmagic_damage_dice</p><p>Every second continuation die in a non-Magic attack restores 1 Magic. Maximum: 5 Magic per attack; never above 100 Magic.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 103</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-cross_crush_panic" data-title="Crash the Party"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Crash the Party</h2><section class="entry" id="CROSS_CRUSH_PANIC"><h3>Crash the Party</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 and CHA 17 / Pusher; Dreadful</p><p>Your wall crush forces an eligible target to check Morale, even during its normal recheck cooldown. Once per target every 3 seconds.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with physical push</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 104</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-cross_force_of_will" data-title="Force of Will"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Force of Will</h2><section class="entry" id="CROSS_FORCE_OF_WILL"><h3>Force of Will</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 and WIS 15 / Pusher; Force Multiplier</p><p>Magic that already pushes can trigger Pusher, Shover or Space Hog after Force Multiplier. A successful proc adds 168 units and uses your Pusher wall-slam die. Shared per-target cooldown: 0.5 seconds.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, eligible AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 105</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-cross_meteor_strike" data-title="Meteor Strike"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Meteor Strike</h2><section class="entry" id="CROSS_METEOR_STRIKE"><h3>Meteor Strike</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 and INT 15 / Bash; Cloud Step</p><p>After using Cloud Step, your first Crowbar hit before landing adds one exploding d6 and doubles its Crowbar push. A miss does not consume this strike. Landing resets it.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes/human Soldiers with Crowbar-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 106</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-cross_tiny_terror" data-title="Tiny Terror"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Tiny Terror</h2><section class="entry" id="CROSS_TINY_TERROR"><h3>Tiny Terror</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 and CHA 15 / Little Guy; Menacing</p><p>While Little Guy is active, gain +2 Morale DC against enemies within 2 connected cells. This stacks with Menacing.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 107</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_burst_size" data-title="Extra Round"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Extra Round</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_BURSTER_1"><h3>Extra Round</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Add 1 rounds to existing multi-shot bursts at their normal spacing and damage, with no extra ammunition cost. Single shots and Shotgun pellets are not bursts.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI actors with an authored weapon attack tagged multiFireBurst</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_BURSTER_2"><h3>Extended Volley</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 / requires Extra Round</p><p>Add 2 rounds to existing multi-shot bursts at their normal spacing and damage, with no extra ammunition cost. Single shots and Shotgun pellets are not bursts. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI actors with an authored weapon attack tagged multiFireBurst</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_BURSTER_3"><h3>Full Barrage</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 17 / requires Extended Volley</p><p>Add 3 rounds to existing multi-shot bursts at their normal spacing and damage, with no extra ammunition cost. Single shots and Shotgun pellets are not bursts. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI actors with an authored weapon attack tagged multiFireBurst</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 108</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_clumsy_proc" data-title="Distracting"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Distracting</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_CLUMSY_PROC_1"><h3>Distracting</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Clumsy. The target saves with DEX against your DEX modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_CLUMSY_PROC_2"><h3>Disorienting</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 / requires Distracting</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Clumsy. The target saves with DEX against your DEX modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_CLUMSY_PROC_3"><h3>Discombobulating</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 17 / requires Disorienting</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Clumsy. The target saves with DEX against your DEX modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 109</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_exploding_damage_dice" data-title="Perfect Ten"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Perfect Ten</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_EXPLODE_D10"><h3>Perfect Ten</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Your ordinary d10 damage dice explode on their maximum face. Continuations explode at 10 minus BoomShift, minimum 2. Maximum: 32 dice per chain. Earlier die unlocks remain active.</p><p class="actors">Non-Rogue heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with d10 damage rolls</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_EXPLODE_D8"><h3>Eight Is Enough</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 / requires Perfect Ten</p><p>Your ordinary d8 damage dice explode on their maximum face. Continuations explode at 8 minus BoomShift, minimum 2. Maximum: 32 dice per chain. Earlier die unlocks remain active.</p><p class="actors">Non-Rogue heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with d8 damage rolls</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_EXPLODE_D4"><h3>Fourtunate</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 17 / requires Eight Is Enough</p><p>Your ordinary d4 damage dice explode on their maximum face. Continuations explode at 4 minus BoomShift, minimum 2. Maximum: 32 dice per chain. Earlier die unlocks remain active.</p><p class="actors">Non-Rogue heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with d4 damage rolls</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 110</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_immolate_proc" data-title="Singeing"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Singeing</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_IMMOLATE_PROC_1"><h3>Singeing</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Immolated. The target saves with DEX against your DEX modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_IMMOLATE_PROC_2"><h3>Scorching</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 / requires Singeing</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Immolated. The target saves with DEX against your DEX modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_IMMOLATE_PROC_3"><h3>Incendiary</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 17 / requires Scorching</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Immolated. The target saves with DEX against your DEX modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 111</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_magnum_deadeye" data-title="Deadeye"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Deadeye</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_MAGNUM_DEADEYE"><h3>Deadeye</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15</p><p>Stand perfectly still for 0.5 seconds to empower your next primary attack: double damage with a standard weapon, or triple damage with the .357 Magnum. One attack consumes the aim.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled actors using a standard player weapon</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 112</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_rate_of_fire" data-title="Hair Trigger"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Hair Trigger</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_RATE_OF_FIRE_1"><h3>Hair Trigger</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Increase ordinary firearm primary-fire rate by 10%. Reloads, cooling, targeting windups and spacing within bursts stay unchanged.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI whose equipped/authored ordinary firearm uses the shared attack-cadence authority</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_RATE_OF_FIRE_2"><h3>Rapid Fire</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 / requires Hair Trigger</p><p>Increase ordinary firearm primary-fire rate by 20%. Reloads, cooling, targeting windups and spacing within bursts stay unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI whose equipped/authored ordinary firearm uses the shared attack-cadence authority</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_RATE_OF_FIRE_3"><h3>Lead Storm</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 17 / requires Rapid Fire</p><p>Increase ordinary firearm primary-fire rate by 30%. Reloads, cooling, targeting windups and spacing within bursts stay unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI whose equipped/authored ordinary firearm uses the shared attack-cadence authority</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 113</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_reload_cadence" data-title="Quick Reload"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Quick Reload</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_FAST_RELOAD"><h3>Quick Reload</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Reduce ordinary weapon reload time by 20%. This does not shorten SMG cooling or attack windups.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes/human Soldiers; AI only when its authored weapon uses the shared reload authority</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_FAST_RELOAD_2"><h3>Lightning Reload</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 / requires Quick Reload</p><p>Reduce ordinary weapon reload time by 40%. This does not shorten SMG cooling or attack windups. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes/human Soldiers; AI only when its authored weapon uses the shared reload authority</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_FAST_RELOAD_3"><h3>Blink Reload</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 17 / requires Lightning Reload</p><p>Reduce ordinary weapon reload time by 60%. This does not shorten SMG cooling or attack windups. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes/human Soldiers; AI only when its authored weapon uses the shared reload authority</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 114</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_shrink" data-title="Little Guy"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Little Guy</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_SHRINK"><h3>Little Guy</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15</p><p>Your visible body becomes 30% smaller. Your movement hull, weapon traces and interaction reach stay the same. Incompatible with Big Guy.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 115</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_smg_heat" data-title="Cold Hands"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Cold Hands</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_SMG_COLD_HANDS_1"><h3>Cold Hands</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Each SMG round has a 11% chance to add no heat. Overheat threshold: 8. Overheating still locks firing for 2 seconds.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers who possess/use the SMG</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_SMG_COLD_HANDS_2"><h3>Ice in the Veins</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15 / requires Cold Hands</p><p>Each SMG round has a 22% chance to add no heat. Overheat threshold: 10. Overheating still locks firing for 2 seconds. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers who possess/use the SMG</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_SMG_COLD_HANDS_3"><h3>Absolute Zero</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 17 / requires Ice in the Veins</p><p>Each SMG round has a 33% chance to add no heat. Overheat threshold: 12. Overheating still locks firing for 2 seconds. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers who possess/use the SMG</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 116</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_spring_heel" data-title="Spring Heel"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Spring Heel</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_SPRING_HEEL"><h3>Spring Heel</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 13</p><p>Double the height of voluntary jumps, including Wall Jump and Cloud Step. Ceilings, wall-top barriers and locked routes still block travel.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 117</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_strafe" data-title="Strafer"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Strafer</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_STRAFER_1"><h3>Strafer</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Strafe 11% faster on the ground. Only the sideways component changes on diagonals. The ordinary speed cap still applies.</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_SIDELER_2"><h3>Sideler</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Strafe 22% faster on the ground. Only the sideways component changes on diagonals. The ordinary speed cap still applies. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><section class="entry" id="DEX_LATERAL_MOVER_3"><h3>Lateral Mover</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Strafe 33% faster on the ground. Only the sideways component changes on diagonals. The ordinary speed cap still applies. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 118</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-dex_wall_jump" data-title="Wall Jump"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Wall Jump</h2><section class="entry" id="DEX_WALL_JUMP"><h3>Wall Jump</h3><p class="requirement">DEX 15</p><p>Press Jump within 24 units of a vertical wall to jump and kick away. Four uses before landing; no Magic cost. Spring Heel increases the jump height.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 119</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_ammo_regeneration_floor" data-title="Field Supply"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Field Supply</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_AMMO_FLOOR_44"><h3>Field Supply</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13</p><p>Owned regenerative firearm ammunition refills to 44% of family capacity, rounded up. Regeneration timing and capacity stay unchanged; consumables and AR2 secondary ammo are excluded.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with regenerative firearm ammunition</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_AMMO_FLOOR_55"><h3>Deep Reserves</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / requires Field Supply</p><p>Owned regenerative firearm ammunition refills to 55% of family capacity, rounded up. Regeneration timing and capacity stay unchanged; consumables and AR2 secondary ammo are excluded. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with regenerative firearm ammunition</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_AMMO_FLOOR_66"><h3>War Stock</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / requires Deep Reserves</p><p>Owned regenerative firearm ammunition refills to 66% of family capacity, rounded up. Regeneration timing and capacity stay unchanged; consumables and AR2 secondary ammo are excluded. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with regenerative firearm ammunition</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 120</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_arc_recovery" data-title="Arc Recovery"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Arc Recovery</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_ARC_RECOVERY"><h3>Arc Recovery</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / magic_pool</p><p>Kill an AI enemy with Magic damage to restore 5 Magic, up to 100. Cooldown: 2 seconds.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 121</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_arcane_disruption_proc" data-title="Disruptor"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Disruptor</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_ARCANE_PROC_1"><h3>Disruptor</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13</p><p>A nonmagical physical hit has a 11% chance to force a surviving target with an active Arcane Shield to make an INT Arcane Integrity save. Failure shatters the shield. Feedback from that hit resolves first.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_ARCANE_PROC_2"><h3>Spellbreaker</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / requires Disruptor</p><p>A nonmagical physical hit has a 22% chance to force a surviving target with an active Arcane Shield to make an INT Arcane Integrity save. Failure shatters the shield. Feedback from that hit resolves first. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_ARCANE_PROC_3"><h3>Nullifier</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / requires Spellbreaker</p><p>A nonmagical physical hit has a 33% chance to force a surviving target with an active Arcane Shield to make an INT Arcane Integrity save. Failure shatters the shield. Feedback from that hit resolves first. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 122</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_backpedal" data-title="W,A,S,Deborah"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>W,A,S,Deborah</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_WAS_DEBORAH"><h3>W,A,S,Deborah</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move backward 25% faster, including backward diagonals. This affects voluntary ground movement and obeys the ordinary speed cap.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 123</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_cloud_step" data-title="Cloud Step"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Cloud Step</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_CLOUD_STEP"><h3>Cloud Step</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Magic pool</p><p>Once before landing, press Jump in the air for a 3-Magic extra jump with 2× takeoff impulse. Hold a direction for a horizontal boost. Invisible walls block maze shortcuts; Wall Jump takes priority.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 124</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_extracurricular_activity" data-title="Extracurricular Activity"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Extracurricular Activity</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_EXTRACURRICULAR_ACTIVITY"><h3>Extracurricular Activity</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / unowned Magic content</p><p>Learn one new Magic content immediately. Your later scheduled grants remain available.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 125</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_feedback_loop" data-title="Feedback Loop"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Feedback Loop</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_FEEDBACK_LOOP"><h3>Feedback Loop</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / magic_pool</p><p>Each continuation die rolled by your offensive Magic restores 1 Magic. Maximum: 6 per cast, up to 100 Magic. Initial dice do not count.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 126</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_float_on" data-title="Float On"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Float On</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_FLOAT_ON"><h3>Float On</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / Magic pool</p><p>Once before landing, hold Jump at your apex to float for up to 3 seconds, spending 5 Magic per second. Release Jump, land or run out of Magic to end it.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 127</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_grand_unified_theory" data-title="Grand Unified Theory"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Grand Unified Theory</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_GRAND_UNIFIED_THEORY"><h3>Grand Unified Theory</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / unowned Magic form</p><p>Learn one new Magic form immediately. Your later scheduled grants remain available.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 128</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_haste" data-title="Haste"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Haste</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_HASTE_1"><h3>Haste</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Magic pool</p><p>Press H to toggle double ground movement speed, subject to the ordinary cap. Drain 100% of your minimap Magic rate per second; map drain adds separately. Regeneration stops while active. At 0 Magic or on death, Haste ends.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_HASTE_2"><h3>Mana Rush</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / requires Haste</p><p>Press H to toggle double ground movement speed, subject to the ordinary cap. Drain two-thirds of your minimap Magic rate per second; map drain adds separately. Regeneration stops while active. At 0 Magic or on death, Haste ends. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_HASTE_3"><h3>Aether Drive</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / requires Mana Rush</p><p>Press H to toggle double ground movement speed, subject to the ordinary cap. Drain one-third of your minimap Magic rate per second; map drain adds separately. Regeneration stops while active. At 0 Magic or on death, Haste ends. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 129</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_mana_spring" data-title="Mana Spring"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Mana Spring</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_SPRING"><h3>Mana Spring</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / magic_pool</p><p>After reaching 0 Magic, your next permitted regeneration is 50% faster for 4 seconds. Sustained effects that block regeneration pause this timer.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 130</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_map_movement" data-title="World Walker"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>World Walker</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_WORLD_WALKER_1"><h3>World Walker</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move 25% faster while your minimap is open. Closing it or exhausting Magic ends the bonus. The ordinary speed cap still applies.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_GLOBETROTTER_2"><h3>Globetrotter</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move 50% faster while your minimap is open. Closing it or exhausting Magic ends the bonus. The ordinary speed cap still applies. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_MIND_STRIDER_3"><h3>Mind Strider</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Move 75% faster while your minimap is open. Closing it or exhausting Magic ends the bonus. The ordinary speed cap still applies. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 131</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_quantum_cost" data-title="Quantum Mathematics"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Quantum Mathematics</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_QUANTUM_MATHEMATICS_1"><h3>Quantum Mathematics</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Offensive active Magic costs 11% less; round costs up, minimum 1. Utility Magic and sustained drain are unchanged.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_QUANTUM_MECHANICS_2"><h3>Quantum Mechanics</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Offensive active Magic costs 22% less; round costs up, minimum 1. Utility Magic and sustained drain are unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_QUANTUM_MASTERY_3"><h3>Quantum Mastery</h3><p class="requirement"></p><p>Offensive active Magic costs 33% less; round costs up, minimum 1. Utility Magic and sustained drain are unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 132</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_russian_asset" data-title="Russian Asset"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Russian Asset</h2><section class="entry" id="CON_RUSSIAN_ASSET"><h3>Russian Asset</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Tetris access</p><p>Double Tetris HP rewards to 20/60/100/160 for 1/2/3/4 lines. Death Tetris lasts up to 120 seconds. The 20-second respawn lock and victory window stay unchanged.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled cooperative heroes with Tetris access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 133</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_size_shifter" data-title="Size Shifter"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Size Shifter</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_SIZE_SHIFTER"><h3>Size Shifter</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13</p><p>Hold Crouch for 3 seconds to shrink your visible body to 33% size. Release to grow back at the same rate. Your ordinary crouched movement hull stays unchanged.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes and human Soldiers only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 134</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-int_summon_management" data-title="Middle Manager"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Middle Manager</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_MIDDLE_MANAGER"><h3>Middle Manager</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13 / Summon Form</p><p>You may have 2 Seeker summons at once. Casting at the limit fails without spending Magic. Other Summon rules stay unchanged.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_TASKMASTER"><h3>Taskmaster</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / Summon Form</p><p>You may have 3 Seeker summons at once. Casting at the limit fails without spending Magic. Other Summon rules stay unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_OVERLORD"><h3>Overlord</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / Summon Form</p><p>You may have 4 Seeker summons at once. Casting at the limit fails without spending Magic. Other Summon rules stay unchanged. Replaces lower ranks.</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 135</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-mana_barrier" data-title="Mana Barrier"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Mana Barrier</h2><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_BARRIER_1"><h3>Mana Barrier</h3><p class="requirement">INT 13</p><p>Spend Magic to divert 15% of damage remaining after mitigation, at 1 Magic per HP prevented. Limited by current Magic. Unavailable to Wizards.</p><p class="actors">Eligible non-Wizard heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_BARRIER_2"><h3>Arcane Aegis</h3><p class="requirement">INT 15 / Mana Barrier</p><p>Spend Magic to divert 30% of damage remaining after mitigation, at 1 Magic per HP prevented. Limited by current Magic. Unavailable to Wizards. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Eligible non-Wizard heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="INT_MANA_BARRIER_3"><h3>Mystic Bastion</h3><p class="requirement">INT 17 / Arcane Aegis</p><p>Spend Magic to divert 45% of damage remaining after mitigation, at 1 Magic per HP prevented. Limited by current Magic. Unavailable to Wizards. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Eligible non-Wizard heroes, human Soldiers, and Magic-using AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 136</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_bleed_proc" data-title="Bloodletter"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Bloodletter</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_BLEED_PROC_1"><h3>Bloodletter</h3><p class="requirement">STR 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Bleeding. The target saves with CON against your CON modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_BLEED_PROC_2"><h3>Deep Wounds</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / requires Bloodletter</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Bleeding. The target saves with CON against your CON modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_BLEED_PROC_3"><h3>Exsanguinator</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires Deep Wounds</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Bleeding. The target saves with CON against your CON modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 137</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_crowbar_crush" data-title="Wrecking Bar"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Wrecking Bar</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_CROWBAR_CRUSH"><h3>Wrecking Bar</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires Walloper</p><p>Add one die to your Crowbar wall-slam damage. Use the current wall-slam die and its explosion rules.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 138</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_crowbar_damage" data-title="Bash"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Bash</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_CROWBAR_D6"><h3>Bash</h3><p class="requirement">STR 13</p><p>Your Crowbar deals exploding d6 damage. Each nonlethal hit attempts a 168-unit physical push.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_CROWBAR_D12"><h3>Walloper</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / requires Bash</p><p>Your Crowbar deals SUPER exploding d12 damage. Each nonlethal hit attempts a 168-unit physical push. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 139</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_melee_reach" data-title="Long Reach"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Long Reach</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_MELEE_REACH"><h3>Long Reach</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / melee-family access</p><p>Gain 25% melee reach. Blocking walls, gates and floors still stop the attack.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with melee-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 140</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_pusher" data-title="Pusher"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Pusher</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_KNOCKBACK_1"><h3>Pusher</h3><p class="requirement">STR 13</p><p>Nonlethal ordinary weapon hits have a 25% chance to add a 168-unit push, subject to a STR save. Successful proc cooldown: 0.5 seconds per target. Physical wall slams use sealed d8.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an ordinary weapon capable of damaging a pushable hostile</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_KNOCKBACK_2"><h3>Shover</h3><p class="requirement">STR 15 / requires Pusher</p><p>Nonlethal ordinary weapon hits have a 50% chance to add a 168-unit push, subject to a STR save. Successful proc cooldown: 0.5 seconds per target. Physical wall slams use sealed d10. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an ordinary weapon capable of damaging a pushable hostile</p></section><section class="entry" id="STR_KNOCKBACK_3"><h3>Space Hog</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires Shover</p><p>Nonlethal ordinary weapon hits have a 75% chance to add a 168-unit push, subject to a STR save. Successful proc cooldown: 0.5 seconds per target. Physical wall slams use SUPER exploding d12. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an ordinary weapon capable of damaging a pushable hostile</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 141</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-str_steamroller" data-title="Steamroller"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Steamroller</h2><section class="entry" id="STR_STEAMROLLER"><h3>Steamroller</h3><p class="requirement">STR 17 / requires an authored push-capable attack or effect</p><p>Targets that save against your push still move half the size-adjusted distance. Failed saves take full distance. Push immunity, resistance and collision still apply.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with an authored push-capable attack or effect</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 142</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_astral_reach" data-title="Astral Reach"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Astral Reach</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_ASTRAL_REACH"><h3>Astral Reach</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / owns a Magic Form</p><p>Add 2 cells to Magic form dimensions that scale with WIS.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 143</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_attunement" data-title="Attunement"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Attunement</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_ATTUNEMENT"><h3>Attunement</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / owns an elemental Magic attack</p><p>When your elemental Magic exploits a weakness, roll the weakness bonus twice and keep the higher result.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and eligible AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 144</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_breadcrumb_range" data-title="Surveyor"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Surveyor</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SURVEYOR"><h3>Surveyor</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Extend your breadcrumb route by 4 cells. Map degradation and floor restrictions still apply.</p><p class="actors">Heroes and human Soldiers with minimap access</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_CARTOGRAPHER"><h3>Cartographer</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Surveyor</p><p>Extend your breadcrumb route by 8 cells. Map degradation and floor restrictions still apply. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes and human Soldiers with minimap access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 145</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_forceful_magic" data-title="Force Multiplier"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Force Multiplier</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_FORCEFUL_MAGIC"><h3>Force Multiplier</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / magic_push</p><p>Increase your Magic push distance by 25%. Physical push feats require Force of Will to apply.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI with a Magic push</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 146</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_frugal_map" data-title="Frugal Cartography"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Frugal Cartography</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_FRUGAL_MAP"><h3>Frugal Cartography</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>Reduce minimap Magic drain by 15%, to a minimum of 3 Magic per second. Magic does not regenerate while the map is open.</p><p class="actors">Heroes and human Soldiers with minimap access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 147</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_gps" data-title="GPS"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>GPS</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_GPS"><h3>GPS</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17</p><p>Press G to toggle spoken directions to the current objective; starts enabled and costs no Magic. Stand still for 1 second with no living enemy within 2 same-floor cells to hear a direction. Repeats after 4 seconds of silence. Movement, danger and inactive play stop speech.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled Heroes only</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 148</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_held_proc" data-title="Snaring"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Snaring</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_HELD_PROC_1"><h3>Snaring</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Held. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_HELD_PROC_2"><h3>Binding</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Snaring</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Held. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_HELD_PROC_3"><h3>Entrapping</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Binding</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Held. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 149</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_hero_of_legend" data-title="Hero of Legend"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Hero of Legend</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_HERO_OF_LEGEND"><h3>Hero of Legend</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>At HP ≥ the lower of 100 or your MaxHP, a Crowbar swing launches a glowing Crowbar that deals your current Crowbar die as non-elemental Magic. Range: at least 1 cell, or your WIS bonus if higher. Only one such projectile may exist at a time.</p><p class="actors">Player-controlled heroes and human Soldiers with Crowbar/Long-Sword-family access</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 150</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_killer_instinct" data-title="Killer Instinct"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Killer Instinct</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_KILLER_INSTINCT"><h3>Killer Instinct</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>After viewing at least two visible enemies for 0.5 seconds, a red outline marks the best target for your equipped weapon: strongest one-shot kill margin, otherwise fewest estimated shots to kill. Rechecks once per second. Losing the multi-enemy view clears it; it grants no aim assistance.</p><p class="actors">Human-controlled Heroes and Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 151</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_mind_over_matter" data-title="Mind Over Matter"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Mind Over Matter</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_MIND_OVER_MATTER"><h3>Mind Over Matter</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires True Faith</p><p>When ready, reduce incoming physical damage by your positive WIS modifier, once per damage event before Magic diversion. Cooldown: 3d4 seconds; these timing dice do not explode. Damage cannot fall below 0.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 152</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_mute_proc" data-title="Hushing"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Hushing</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_MUTE_PROC_1"><h3>Hushing</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Muted. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_MUTE_PROC_2"><h3>Silencing</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Hushing</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Muted. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_MUTE_PROC_3"><h3>Dead Air</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Silencing</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Muted. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 153</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_omniscience" data-title="Omniscience"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Omniscience</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_OMNISCIENCE"><h3>Omniscience</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17</p><p>Look at a visible monster to see its type, level, class and current/max HP. Human Soldiers retain their player identity above these stats.</p><p class="actors">Human Heroes and human Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 154</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_reckless_proc" data-title="Agitating"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Agitating</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_RECKLESS_PROC_1"><h3>Agitating</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Your hit has a 11% chance to attempt Reckless. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_RECKLESS_PROC_2"><h3>Unhinging</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Agitating</p><p>Your hit has a 22% chance to attempt Reckless. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_RECKLESS_PROC_3"><h3>Maddening</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Unhinging</p><p>Your hit has a 33% chance to attempt Reckless. The target saves with WIS against your WIS modifier; success prevents the condition. Hits already attempting that condition do not roll again. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, AI with an eligible attributable damaging attack</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 155</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_sixth_sense" data-title="Sixth Sense"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Sixth Sense</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SIXTH_SENSE"><h3>Sixth Sense</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>See normally visible invisible entities as translucent silhouettes. Outline living enemies within 2 cells on your floor, even through walls. Hear private positional movement sounds from same-floor Watchers. These senses grant no attacks or interactions through walls.</p><p class="actors">Cooperative Heroes</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 156</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_spatial_awareness" data-title="Spatial Awareness"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Spatial Awareness</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPATIAL_AWARENESS"><h3>Spatial Awareness</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>Warn when an enemy becomes visible behind or beside you on your floor. Rear range: your WIS modifier, minimum 1 cell, in a 3-cell-wide strip; side range: half that, rounded up. A violet direction cue and named alert identify one target; no repeat while it stays detected.</p><p class="actors">Human Heroes and human Soldiers</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 157</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_spellward" data-title="Spellward"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>Spellward</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPELLWARD"><h3>Spellward</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 13</p><p>Gain +2 to Magic saves against resistible magical effects.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPELLBREAKER"><h3>Spellbreaker</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15 / requires Spellward</p><p>Gain +4 to Magic saves against resistible magical effects. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><section class="entry" id="WIS_SPELLBANE"><h3>Spellbane</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 17 / requires Spellbreaker</p><p>Gain +6 to Magic saves against resistible magical effects. Replaces lower ranks.</p><p class="actors">Heroes, human Soldiers, and AI</p></section><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 158</div></article><article class="page" id="feat-wis_true_faith" data-title="True Faith"><div class="kicker">Feat reference</div><h2>True Faith</h2><section class="entry" id="WIS_TRUE_FAITH"><h3>True Faith</h3><p class="requirement">WIS 15</p><p>Reduce incoming magical damage by your positive WIS modi]====]
